{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-o030a","title":"尚书仆射存上疏议孙虑正名号与任镇军大将军","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-b9a474ec04ddc5f37d85","label":"正文","text":"尚书仆射存上疏议孙虑正名号与任镇军大将军","evidence":["santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0057","role":"被议正名号与授任者","evidence":["santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0045","role":"被自陈与议者","evidence":["santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80","source_order":[59,30,0],"order":10445}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0045","name":"顾雍","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0057","name":"孙虑","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-3c7b5828472a89e5db80","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-d99ee165eeacf1891b28","layer":"original","quote":"久之，尚书仆射存上疏曰〖2〗：“帝王之兴，莫不褒崇至亲，以光群后〖3〗。故鲁、卫于周〖4〗，宠冠诸侯；高帝五王〖5〗，封列于汉：所以藩屏本朝，为国镇卫。建昌侯虑，禀性聪敏，才兼文武；于古典制，宜正名号。陛下谦光〖6〗，未肯如旧；群僚大小，咸用於邑〖7〗。方今奸寇恣睢〖8〗，金鼓未弭〖9〗；腹心爪牙，惟亲与贤。辄与丞相雍等议，咸以虑‘宜为镇军大将军，授任偏方〖10〗，以光大业’。”","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
